{"articleNo":"330815","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=330815&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [한국환경산업기술원] 2021-3차 재활용환경성평가 전문인력 양성과정 교육생 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.10.25","hit":"37210","attachments":[{"name":"2021-3차 재활용환경성평가 전문인력 양성과정 교육생 모집 안내문.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=330815&attachNo=105574"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; text-align: left; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); text-transform: none; line-height: 24px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Dotum; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>1. 교육목적</strong></span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">재활용관리제도 전환 및 재활용환경성평가제도 시행에 따라 폐기물의 재활용이 사람의 건강이나 환경에 미치는 영향을 평가하는 전문인력양성</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">- 재활용 공정 및 기술 등 이론과정 및 유해특성 실험·실습, 보고서 작성 등 실무 중심의 교육과정 운영</span></p><p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; text-align: left; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); text-transform: none; line-height: 24px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Dotum; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>2. 교육개요</strong></span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">(신청기간) 10.7(목) ~ 10.26(화)</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">(교육기간) 11.1(월) ~ 11.10(수), 2주</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">(교육비용) 교육비 및 교재 무료</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">(교육방식) 비대면(온라인) 및 오프라인 병행 (한국환경산업기술원(서울 은평구 소재) ※ 교육장소 약도 참조)</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; text-align: left; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); text-transform: none; line-height: 24px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Dotum; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>3. 교육대상</strong></span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">(선발인원) 20명</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp; ※ 선발대상자는 이메일과 문자로 개별 통보</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">(자격요건) 환경분야 산업기사 이상 또는 현장실무경력 1년 이상인 자</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp; ※ 우대사항 : 환경관련 측정분석기관 재직 중이거나, 근무경력자 우선 선발</span></p><p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; text-align: left; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); text-transform: none; line-height: 24px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Dotum; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>4. 교육과정</strong></span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">(교육내용) 재활용개론 등 이론 3개 과정, 평가실무 등 심화·실습 2개 과정</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">(수료기준) 교육시간의 80%이상 출석 및 수료평가 60점 이상 합격자</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">(교육 우수 수료생 혜택) 한국환경산업기술원장 표창 수여</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; text-align: left; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); text-transform: none; line-height: 24px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Dotum; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>5. 교육신청 및 제출서류</strong></span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">(신청방법) 온라인 접수(</span><a class=\"tx-link\" style=\"background: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 14.4px; font-size: 12px; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; box-sizing: border-box;\" href=\"http://www.eduet.or.kr/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>www.eduet.or.kr</strong></span></a><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">) </span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">(제출서류) 학력증명서, 경력(재직)증명서, 자격증 사본 등 첨부파일 업로드</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">(문의처) 한국환경산업기술원 기업육성실(02-2284-1708/1718)</span></p><p style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; text-align: left; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); text-transform: none; line-height: 24px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Dotum; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
